      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the scene as the target of the threat",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the viewer's role in the scene, as the person holding the guns is aiming directly at them. The text 'oops, too late... you're dead' explicitly addresses the user as the target of the implied violence, creating a direct projection of the user onto the threatening scene. The user is not projected onto a specific visual material or textual material, but onto the entire threatening_pose_with_guns scene, which includes the person, the guns, and the implied danger directed at the viewer.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
